<div>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8">
    Lexdrel Operations
  </h1>

  <% if user_signed_in? %>
    <p class="mb-4">Welcome back, <%= current_user.first_name %>!</p>
  <% else %>
    <div class="justify-center space-x-4 mb-8 text-center">
      <h3>Welcome to the Lexdrel Operations portal.</h3>
      <p>This platform is strictly reserved for authorized and authenticated users. To access any operational features, system tools, or internal resources, you must be properly verified through the established security protocols. Unauthorized access is not permitted and all activity is monitored to ensure the integrity and confidentiality of Lexdrel’s operational environment.</p>
      <p>If you believe you should have access, or if you require additional information regarding permissions, authentication procedures, or system usage, please reach out to our support contact at: alex@lexdrel.com</p>
      <p>Thank you for your understanding and cooperation in maintaining a secure operational ecosystem.</p>
    </div>
  <% end %>

</div>
